The original superpowers project established the core pattern of skill-based
workflow routing for LLM assistants. superpowers-optimized extended this with
comprehensive hooks, token-efficiency optimizations, and additional engineering
workflows. normalpowers adapted the pattern for generalist knowledge workers
outside the software development domain.

austinpowers combines and extends both, providing a unified plugin for teams
whose work spans software engineering and knowledge work.

